# Spec

Design of record: `docs/sdd.md`. Ping-pong is a prototype only.

Do not introduce: EnTT, `Node` / `NodeEcs` / `NodeUI`, `EventBus` Subscribe/Emit, `CmdCustomDraw`, UI `onClick` lambdas, `Get("file.png")`, `Transform` parent, service locator (`Engine::GetAudio()`).

Public headers may include glm. They must not include SDL, glad, NanoVG, spdlog, tinyxml2, or mixer.

UI → game is `ICommand` on a `ViewModel`. Draw through `CommandBuffer` with `IMaterial` on meshes. Assets by `AssetId` only.
